Package: hed
Architecture: any
Depends: 
    ${shlibs:Depends}, 
    ${misc:Depends}
Description: human editor — in-place insert and replace tools
 hed provides insert(1) and repl(1) for editing files in place:
 insert splices text or file contents at a line position; repl does
 batch pattern replacement with grep-like matching options.
 Files are rewritten only when their contents would change.
